      "summary_en": "Gangplank uncovers a powder keg at target location. If he attacks it, it explodes, spreading the attack's damage to enemies in the area, slowing them.",
      "summary_zh": "普朗克在目标区域为一个火药桶开盖。如果他攻击火药桶，那么火药桶会爆炸，将这次攻击的伤害传播到范围内的敌人身上，并将他们减速。",
